This repository vendors a copy of MitID-BrowserClient for offline MitID
authentication inside Home Assistant:

  https://github.com/Hundter/MitID-BrowserClient

Copyright (c) 2024 Hundter
Licensed under the MIT License.

The vendored copy lives in:
  custom_components/kmd_easy_energy/mitid_browserclient/

The full MIT license text is at:
  custom_components/kmd_easy_energy/mitid_browserclient/LICENSE

CLI helpers (Helpers.py) and example login flows from the upstream project
are not included; only BrowserClient and CustomSRP are used at runtime.

