The E|Forsyning backend is derived from kpoppel/homeassistant-eforsyning:

  https://github.com/kpoppel/homeassistant-eforsyning

Copyright kpoppel and contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Derived files (each carries a header saying it is derived and that changes
were made):
  custom_components/kmd_easy_energy/api/eforsyning_client.py

The protocol (login flow and data endpoints) was studied from that project
and reimplemented as an async aiohttp client; no code was copied verbatim.
The full Apache License 2.0 text, as distributed by the upstream project, is at:
  custom_components/kmd_easy_energy/api/LICENSE-eforsyning-Apache-2.0.txt

The upstream project does not ship a NOTICE file. Test fixtures in
tests/fixtures_eforsyning.py use invented values in the response shapes
handled by the upstream client.

Thank you to kpoppel and the contributors of homeassistant-eforsyning.

